riod', moduleId=42, description='Time to develop the final presentation with the initial final project proposal, highlighting the changes that we consider that are going to improve the productivity of ORACLE teams and also are going to decrease the expenses of ORACLE as company. ', dateLimit=null, responsible=5, endingDate=null, estimatedTime=2, actualTime=3, creation_ts=2025-04-05T14:55:07.719128-06:00, done=true, story_Points=4}, ToDoItem{id=89, title='Select the change to do for first period.', moduleId=42, description='Time to analyze the code provided by ORACLE and identify the opportunity areas that this can have. ', dateLimit=null, responsible=5, endingDate=null, estimatedTime=2, actualTime=6, creation_ts=2025-04-05T14:54:39.768315-06:00, done=true, story_Points=3}, ToDoItem{id=87, title='Creation of work repo', moduleId=42, description='Creation of a work repo in which each member is capable of adding their own branches', dateLimit=null, responsible=1, endingDate=null, estimatedTime=1, actualTime=2, creation_ts=2025-04-05T14:53:31.323043-06:00, done=true, story_Points=2}, ToDoItem{id=85, title='Initial task and responsabilities distribution.', moduleId=42, description='Time to start the initial distribution of responsibilities like do the initial code deployment, do the figma, start the documentation of these initial phases, etc. ', dateLimit=null, responsible=1, endingDate=null, estimatedTime=1, actualTime=1, creation_ts=2025-04-05T14:51:16.386314-06:00, done=true, story_Points=3}]}, Module{id=43, title='Front-End Development', body='REfacturing the front to look stetic', categoryId=1, status=1, severity=2, startDate=2025-04-05, dateLimit=2025-04-19, parentModule=null, tasks=[ToDoItem{id=95, title='Understanding of the gived front-end logic', moduleId=43, description='Time to understand the front-end logic in order to be capable of start the development process. ', dateLimit=null, responsible=3, endingDate=null, estimatedTime=2, actualTime=4, creation_ts=20