ze the code provided by ORACLE and identify the opportunity areas that this can have. ', dateLimit=null, responsible=5, endingDate=null, estimatedTime=2, actualTime=6, creation_ts=2025-04-05T14:54:39.768315-06:00, done=true, story_Points=3}, ToDoItem{id=87, title='Creation of work repo', moduleId=42, description='Creation of a work repo in which each member is capable of adding their own branches', dateLimit=null, responsible=1, endingDate=null, estimatedTime=1, actualTime=2, creation_ts=2025-04-05T14:53:31.323043-06:00, done=true, story_Points=2}, ToDoItem{id=88, title='Development of Figma', moduleId=42, description='Create a Figma that matches the design of the project we aim to develop for Oracle', dateLimit=null, responsible=4, endingDate=null, estimatedTime=2, actualTime=4, creation_ts=2025-04-05T14:53:57.440739-06:00, done=true, story_Points=4}]}, Module{id=43, title='Front-End Development', body='REfacturing the front to look stetic', categoryId=1, status=1, severity=2, startDate=2025-04-05, dateLimit=2025-04-19, parentModule=null, tasks=[ToDoItem{id=128, title='Debugging FrontEnd', moduleId=43, description='Time to debug key components (dashboard, navbar, leftBar)', dateLimit=null, responsible=3, endingDate=null, estimatedTime=6, actualTime=6, creation_ts=2025-04-25T02:32:39.515304-06:00, done=true, story_Points=6}, ToDoItem{id=96, title='Develop main UI components', moduleId=43, description='Build key interface elements (e.g., navigation, forms, dashboards).', dateLimit=null, responsible=3, endingDate=null, estimatedTime=3, actualTime=6, creation_ts=2025-04-05T15:10:30.911519-06:00, done=true, story_Points=5}, ToDoItem{id=129, title='Build Report ', moduleId=43, description='Create the reports page (reports components)', dateLimit=2025-04-25, responsible=5, endingDate=null, estimatedTime=2, actualTime=3, creation_ts=2025-04-25T02:34:16.773746-06:00, done=true, story_Points=3}, ToDoItem{id=130, title='Create tasks kpi', moduleId=43, description='Desarrollar